      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Headaches for a short period after metrizamide myelography are common. It is unusual for these headaches to persist beyond four days. The case of a patient whose headache dated from the time of myelography and in whom an intracranial subdural haematoma developed after myelography is presented, to draw attention to this rare complication."},
